# NOTE: data/ is deliberately NOT ignored. phase_1_execution.md Step 5 specifies that the
# seeded generator output (including data/_ground_truth/evidence_ledger.json) is committed,
# so the dataset the pipeline and Phase 11 evaluation run against is reproducible from the repo.

# --- Markdown documentation stays local ---
# Per the project owner: all markdown docs (MASTER_PLAN, decisions_and_progress,
# learning_guide, every phase_<N>_execution.md) are personal reference material and are not
# pushed. README.md is the one exception — it is the repo's front page.
*.md
!README.md
